  "description": "Haunted by memories of the day his father died when he was a child, Jack—who, despite being a soldier, is unable to kill anyone—wanders aimlessly, tormented by this inner conflict, before returning to Italy to avenge his father. There, he meets Reno, the boss of a Mafia organisation whose members are seeking revenge, and ends up saving his life. Using this incident as a pretext, Jack joins Reno’s organisation. Determined to prove his worth to Reno, he attempts a ‘pillow-case murder’ and successfully secures his place within the organisation. Reno then orders Jack, now a full member of the organisation, to commit a murder… *(Source: RIDI, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[R19](https://ridibooks.com/books/2968010681), [R15](https://ridibooks.com/books/2968010687)",
